                "Good fit for websites, mobile apps, and other omnichannel/headless front ends."
            ],
            "limitations": [
                "Headless architecture means a separate user-facing front end must be built or connected.",
                "Strapi 5 does not support MongoDB/other NoSQL databases.",
                "Connecting to a pre-existing database not created by Strapi is unsupported.",
                "GraphQL requires a plugin and media uploads use REST rather than GraphQL."
